  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Dear Edgar,


    I hope this letter finds you well. My daughter, Alice,
    is in desperate need of your help once again. Her condition has worsened over
    the past few months, and as you know, only the alchemists'' healing potions can
    do her good. The potions you provided last time gave her much-needed relief,
    but now her symptoms are severe, and time is running out.


    I implore you
    to prepare and deliver your healing potions once more. We are willing to compensate
    you for your time and resources. Please, consider our plight and help save Alice''s
    life.


    Thank you for your past kindness and for considering this urgent
    request.



'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fca057732a414764684a0642a35b05c5, type: 2}
